## 1. Project Introduction

Aus Weather Watch is a modern, responsive web application that delivers real-time weather information, forecasts, and severe weather alerts for locations across Australia. The project was developed as the major assessment for the ICT171 Cloud Computing unit.

The primary goal was to move beyond theoretical concepts and demonstrate practical, end-to-end skills in cloud infrastructure provisioning (IaaS), Linux server administration, web server configuration, application deployment, DNS management, and secure public access (HTTPS). 

The application is fully functional, publicly accessible, and secured with a custom domain and valid SSL certificate.

